The Dark Knight is a action, crime, thriller film directed by Christopher Nolan.

3
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime.

4
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
With the help of Lt.

5
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle
the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets.

6
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed
by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.

7
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Bruce Wayne, played by Christian Bale.

8
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Joker, played by Heath Ledger.

9
